<TXSPN>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s expression was soft.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Has she found some hope? Or does she feel clearer for having been able to tell me everything?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Either way, I am honestly glad that I could be a support to </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The moonlight was as beautiful as ever, coloring the cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There was no wind, and it felt very good.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
