<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In the distance, the goshinboku of Chuo Park came into view.</STYLE> [TN: the sacred tree of a shrine, held to house a god]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At this hour, naturally, not even a police officer was in sight.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Pouring down from the goshinboku, a blizzard of cherry petals―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is what </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> says she hates.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s dream had blood pouring down from the cherry tree, apparently.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Could it be that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> saw that sight with her own eyes when </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s father died?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If so, it is conceivable that the cherry blossoms have become a trauma for her.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Since they had come for hanami as a family, would </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> not have seen it too?</STYLE> [TN: hanami = cherry-blossom viewing]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But it is better not to bring that up now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now that </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s feelings have finally settled, I should talk about something else.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">... I'm the one who suggested going to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s house, so it's awkward for me to say this, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uh... the Kogori house is going to be busy from now on, isn't it... with the funeral preparations and all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ahh... yeah, true..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What with the murder case and the matter of </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s curse it had gone clean out of my head, but the funeral for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might begin as early as tomorrow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, we would only be in the way. It was only now that I had started to think so.</STYLE><PG>
"Then let's help with the preparations too. We've gotta go to the funeral anyway, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, a dear friend, is going through a terrible time, and it is precisely at such a time that we have to support her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Of course, I feel the same way.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm, I should have brought my uniform from home. For a student, a uniform is fine for a funeral, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
"Huh...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> looked puzzled.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "500" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\公園夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"What are you talking about, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>? For a funeral it's a Noh mask and red vestments, right?" [TN: Noh is classical Japanese theater whose actors wear carved wooden masks]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A Noh mask? Red vestments?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I have never been to anyone's funeral, but I had thought that ordinarily you wear black clothes, or a school uniform if you are a student.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, I have never heard of a Noh mask.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Could it be something religious in the Niimura family?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If that is the case, it is not for me to put in a word about it.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "29" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Right, I'll try calling <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai stopped her bicycle and put her smartphone to her ear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The Niimura-style funeral had struck me as strange, but well, none of that matters now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the one I should be using my head for, so that I can be a support to her.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But, what is it, this feeling that something is off?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is not about the Niimura-style funeral. It is about this murder case.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I am overlooking something. Something important.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For a moment that unease gripped me, but right now I have to get the two of them together quickly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And if all of us can greet the morning together, there will be nothing left to worry about.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All the same, the wind had suddenly picked up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even though there had been no wind at all the whole day...</STYLE><PG>
"That's weird... She's not answering."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Not answering? It can't be...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> being who she is, she should be standing by right next to the phone.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
