{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前夜.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">We stopped the bicycles in front of the apartment building.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was redialing again and again.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Why...! Why won't she answer...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was hammering the elevator button and shouting into a phone nobody was answering.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The elevator was moving slowly and would not come down.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> broke into a run toward the stairs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, wait!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\階段速上り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション階段.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> pulled further and further ahead as I chased after her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Haah! Haah!"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "2000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Gasping for breath, I reached the floor of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s apartment.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\外廊下夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Waaait...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was just then opening</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s front door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The door had apparently been unlocked, and </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> ran on into the apartment.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">I went after her, shoved my hand into the gap of the door as it was closing, and pulled it open all at once.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">There was no sign of anyone inside, and the place was utterly still.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I went into the apartment with my shoes still on and headed for the living room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">What was there was the Kogori family's living room, the same as always.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPD TIME="4294967096">Except that it was a sight much too far removed to be called that.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\古郡家居間死体.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "7000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Is this the kind of sight they call hell?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Blood had spread across the floor, and a great quantity of blood was spattered over the walls too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Collapsed with a great quantity of blood flowing from her head, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With countless knives driven into her abdomen, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Her head alone lying in a place apart from her body, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面フラッシュ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Beside them, a blood-soaked </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="なた">nata</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and a Noh mask had been set down.</STYLE> [TN: a nata is a heavy single-edged Japanese billhook]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A Noh mask... the one </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was talking about a minute ago, that...</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Haah... haah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ragged breathing came from the direction of the kitchen.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I turned around, and </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was there―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Beside her, presumably thrown up by </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, was a puddle of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="としゃぶつ">vomit</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花覗き込み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, look at this, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>... You're still going to tell me there's no curse?
{PAUSE ""}
　Hahaha... Amazing, this is amazing! I'm a witch, see?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> said it without even wiping away the </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="としゃぶつ">vomit</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dripping from her mouth, as though holding back laughter.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"N-</STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">... that's not it... this isn't a curse at all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But my voice was shaking, and I could not stay calm enough to talk sense into </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> walked slowly over to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head.</STYLE>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head raised high in her hands, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> spoke to her quietly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "avemaria.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\証明.lcm" "REPEAT" "20" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE>'re still warm... If I'd gotten here a little sooner, could I have saved you...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The half-open eyes, and the mouth hanging wide open from the loss of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="けいぶ">neck</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> muscles.</STYLE>
