Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> did not move her feet, but her sheer presence made me back away.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, that's not it! This isn't a curse! It's murder! So..."</STYLE><BR>
